WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.825 --> 00:00:08.435
In this video you'll invite a school license administrator, and learn how to resend, reset, edit, and remove one.

2
00:00:08.936 --> 00:00:11.996
On the school's card, select Invite Admin.

3
00:00:12.497 --> 00:00:30.027
Enter their first name, last name, and email. Choose a permission level. Primary and Secondary can both do the day to day work. Primary can also revoke seats and remove teachers. Read Only can see everything but change nothing. You can add a note for your own records.

4
00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:35.371
If the email already has an account, you'll see a note about it. That's fine.

5
00:00:35.873 --> 00:00:43.973
Select Send Invitation. The person is an administrator right away, and they get a welcome email with a button to set their password.

6
00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:53.206
Until they've chosen a password, they show a Pending Setup badge. If they lose the email, select Resend Welcome and they'll get a fresh link.

7
00:00:53.708 --> 00:01:03.208
For someone who's already set up, the button says Reset Password instead. It sends them the standard reset email, with a link that lasts one hour.

8
00:01:03.709 --> 00:01:06.329
Select Edit to change their permission level.

9
00:01:06.831 --> 00:01:15.701
And select Revoke to remove their administrator access. You'll be asked to confirm. Their account stays, but they can no longer manage that school.
